{"about_the_game":"<strong>Scream, gasp, or even whimper into your microphone, and the game restarts.</strong>  Welcome to DON'T SCREAM, an Unreal Engine 5 horror experience inspired by '90s camcorder found footage. The challenge is simple: survive a night in the Forest without screaming or dying\u2026 and escape.<br><br>Sounds easy, right? There\u2019s a catch. Time only progresses when you move, and the scares are unpredictable. Find batteries, avoid hunters, and discover symbols that unlock new locations. With dozens of dynamic scares and many places to explore, every playthrough is a unique and terrifying experience. Keep your eyes open, your wits sharp, and your mic quiet. It\u2019s the perfect game to scare your friends and family.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE NIGHT</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497900/extras/ae51003e521efee0212c8728f0270907.poster.avif?t=1758574704\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497900/extras/ae51003e521efee0212c8728f0270907.webm?t=1758574704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497900/extras/ae51003e521efee0212c8728f0270907.mp4?t=1758574704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dynamic scares ensure no two playthroughs are ever the same; expect the unexpected.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT BATTERIES</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497900/extras/54937747d35fe7cd9736b1a5fca92582.poster.avif?t=1758574704\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2497900/extras/54937747d35fe7cd9736b1a5fca92582.webm?t=1758574704\" type=\"video/webm; c